            "id": "fbf5e2d8-189b-37a8-86ec-a3ea432227b4",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Oracle, Pfizer & Metsera, Kenvue: Trending tickers",
            "description": "<p>Here are some of the stocks on the move on Monday, Sept. 22.</p>\n<p>Oracle (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ORCL\">ORCL</a>) named Clay Magouyrk and Mike Sicilia as co-CEOs. They will replace Safra Catz, who will become the board's executive vice chair.</p>\n<p>Pfizer (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PFE\">PFE</a>) is buying Metsera (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MTSR\">MTSR</a>), a company developing obesity drugs, for $4.9 billion.</p>\n<p>Shares of Kenvue (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/KVUE\">KVUE</a>) are falling following a <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/health/2025/09/21/trump-autism-announcement-tylenol-leucovorin/\">Washington Post report</a> that the Trump administration will link Tylenol to autism.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Here are some of the stocks on the move on Monday, Sept. 22. Oracle (ORCL) named Clay Magouyrk and Mike Sicilia as co-CEOs. They will replace Safra Catz, who will become the board's executive vice chair. Pfizer (PFE) is buying Metsera (MTSR), a company developing obesity drugs, for $4.9 billion. Shares of Kenvue (KVUE) are falling following a Washington Post report that the Trump administration will link Tylenol to autism. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Morning Brief.",
